{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/968097098/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1787328198000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.smithsonianmag.com/science-nature/earths-organisms-developed-via-evolution-some-theorists-wonder-what-if-the-entire-cosmos-did-too-180989338/\" target=\"_blank\">Profile of Julian Gough and his evolutionary cosmology</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://unpublishablepapers.substack.com/p/and-the-universe-said-you-are-the\" target=\"_blank\">the Substack version</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.es/Borges-Edici%C3%B3n-cuidado-Daniel-Martino/dp/8423370496\" target=\"_blank\">New Spanish-language edition of Bioy Casares on Borges coming out</a>.  The older edition was, among other things, too heavy to lug around or bring on a trip.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://viewfromthewing.com/google-buys-spirit-airlines-emails-files-and-fli ght-records-for-10-million-so-gemini-can-learn-from-bankruptcy/\" target=\"_blank\">The market for data is the market of the future</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4.<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://statmodeling.stat.columbia.edu/2026/08/20/we-couldnt-reproduce-their-findings-and-realized-that-it-was-all-driven-by-weird-data-from-uzbekistan/\" target=\"_blank\"> If Uzbekistan were excluded, the damages would look similar to earlier work</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/jamesbroughel/status/2090439460450120103?s=61\" target=\"_blank\">James Broughel on capitalizing AI agents</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/anthpb/status/2090446660283302254?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank